From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: make empty Neighborhood state explicit

An empty Neighborhood model currently leaves MeshBox as a black canvas.  Keep
the Sugar view useful when no peers or shared Activities are present by showing
the same concise empty-state treatment used by GroupBox, making the empty
state explicit instead of presenting an unexplained black canvas.

--- a/src/jarabe/desktop/meshbox.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/desktop/meshbox.py
@@ -380,2 +380,5 @@
         self._query = ''
+        self._empty_state = Gtk.Label(label=_("No people or shared Activities are nearby yet."))
+        self._empty_state.set_opacity(0.72)
+        self.add(self._empty_state)
 
